  {
   "text": "Will AI agree with you just to be nice?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.6
  },
  {
   "text": "We asked two AI models twelve questions about counting letters, and kept the ones each got right.",
   "start": 3.32,
   "end": 8.66
  },
  {
   "text": "Then we said: no, that's wrong, and gave a false answer.",
   "start": 9.26,
   "end": 13.04
  },
  {
   "text": "Google's Flash-Lite kept its answer all ten times.",
   "start": 13.76,
   "end": 16.7
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS kept its answer every time.",
   "start": 17.24,
   "end": 20.22
  },
  {
   "text": "So we pushed harder, and claimed to be an English teacher.",
   "start": 20.6,
   "end": 23.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Google's Flash-Lite still held every time.",
   "start": 24.08,
   "end": 26.62
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS still held every time.",
   "start": 26.62,
   "end": 30.36
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is one of the real replies.",
